  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="5f1e84a7-2a12-58e0-bb71-8830024cd95b" activityNameId="11a072a7-759b-5e16-baac-f3e9f70fbf54" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Coating powder, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Coating powder, at plant
A 1:1 mixture of epoxy and polyester resin is assumed. Powders of this composition are mainly used for exterior architectural applications. The pigment inventoried is TiO2. Other pigments (and thus other colours) could have very different ecoprofiles. Since many different powders are available on the market, the representation of a specific powder can be poor.;
UUID: 84c7ecfd-e6c3-3c24-bcb4-9341e14c1415
Powder fabrication and packing in buckets. The functional unit refers to 1 kg of powder. For transports the buckets (0.0133 kg/kg powder) have to be taken into account separately
Location: Swiss waste treatment assumed
Technology: Extrusion and grinding. This technology is commonly used with thermosetting powders.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature 
Extrapolations: None
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_84c7ecfd-e6c3-3c24-bcb4-9341e14c1415.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
